.TH ORO-HAPTICS 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:haptics \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:haptics'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Optional Android semantic feedback. Applications must retain a user setting and pass it explicitly; system feedback preferences remain authoritative.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBperform(kind, options)\fR
Requests one feedback pulse. Android respects system/view preferences and suppresses pulses less than 100 ms apart. `true` means accepted by the view, not independently measured physical feedback. Other platforms reject `ENOSYS`.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIkind\fR (\&'selection' \\| 'confirmation' \\| 'rejection'; required)
.br
\fIoptions\fR (HapticOptions; optional)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<boolean>\fR
